              {
                "text": "都八点了，来吧。",
                "pinyin": "dōu bā diǎn le ， lái ba 。",
                "meaning": "It is already eight. Come on.",
                "audio": "0784a9e875da1a436b261abd8b6a50aa2546f19e7d62096ad09070838e132bcf"
              },
              {
                "text": "孩子都十岁了。",
                "pinyin": "háizi dōu shí suì le 。",
